WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.538
How is this different from other
coaching?

2
00:00:02.738 --> 00:00:03.943
Two things.

3
00:00:04.143 --> 00:00:06.398
First, everything we
build is custom.

4
00:00:06.598 --> 00:00:08.508
There are no templates.

5
00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:10.541
Your tools are made around your

6
00:00:10.541 --> 00:00:13.149
goals, your challenges and your
situation.

7
00:00:13.149 --> 00:00:15.123
Second, the method is built on the

8
00:00:15.123 --> 00:00:18.365
science of flow, how people
perform at their very best.

9
00:00:18.365 --> 00:00:21.396
And I only teach what I've tested
in my own business.

10
00:00:21.396 --> 00:00:24.216
So it isn't a program you squeeze
yourself into.

11
00:00:24.416 --> 00:00:26.819
It's a toolkit built around you.

12
00:00:27.019 --> 00:00:29.204
Success doesn't happen by accident.

13
00:00:29.404 --> 00:00:31.173
It happens by design.
